{"title": "Fly (class action)", "pageid": 17231, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fly_(class_action)", "categories": ["Class actions", "Movement-expending actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the most common Fly action. For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fly (disambiguation)\">Fly (disambiguation)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fly.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Fly.webp/300px-Fly.webp, /w/images/c/c7/Fly.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Fly.webp/300px-Fly.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Fly.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Fly</b> is a movement action which allows a creature to fly from one position to another. Movement with this action costs half as much as normal movement. This action is commonly used by winged and other flying creatures. It is also accessible to players through spells such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grant_Flight\" title=\"Grant Flight\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Grant_Flight_Icon.webp/20px-Grant_Flight_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Grant_Flight_Icon.webp/30px-Grant_Flight_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Grant_Flight_Icon.webp/40px-Grant_Flight_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grant Flight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Grant_Flight_Icon.webp/20px-Grant_Flight_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Grant_Flight_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grant_Flight\" title=\"Grant Flight\">Grant Flight</a> and certain class features.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nFly to a target position<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Movement_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Resources#Movement_speed\" title=\"Resources\">Movement Speed (Half cost)</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\