<a href=\"/wiki/Mephit\" title=\"Mephit\">Mephit</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mind-Claw_of_Tu%27narath\" title=\"Mind-Claw of Tu'narath\">Mind-Claw of Tu'narath</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\">Mizora</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Moonlight_Sliver\" title=\"Moonlight Sliver\">Moonlight Sliver</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Myrmidon\" title=\"Myrmidon\">Myrmidon</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Phantasm\" title=\"Phantasm\">Phantasm</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Poltergeist\" title=\"Poltergeist\">Poltergeist</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Raven\" title=\"Raven\">Raven</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Spectator\" title=\"Spectator\">Spectator</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Winged_Horror\" title=\"Winged Horror\">Winged Horror</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This is the action granted by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flight_(Condition)\" title=\"Flight (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Flight_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Flight_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Flight_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Flight_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Flight_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Flight_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Flight_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Flight_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Flight_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flight_(Condition)\" title=\"Flight (Condition)\">Flight</a>.</li>\n<li>There are many similar Fly actions aside from this one. Refer to <a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fly (disambiguation)\">Fly (disambiguation)</a> for a list.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034524\nCache expiry: 86400\